<title>AUSTRALIA: Villa World appoints new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Villa World appoints new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer Villa World Ltd said on Wednesday it has appointed Bill Simpson as chief executive officer, following the decision of the two founding executive directors to move to non-executive roles.</p>
<p>Tony Bawden would become chairman and Greg Phillips a director, Villa World said in a statement.</p>
<p>Simpson was previously chief executive officer of New Zealand development and construction company Mainzeal.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
